"1464040821631227", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620940_1464040824964560_2579327269885962615_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Mvdn5iL-TpYQ7kNvwHH5Tpw&_nc_oc=Adp45yLpKNQ0isfnBp4DMjA-5VgwdKb5sTwLsMsK0tFjohMs3Yj-UZdXW4CUHr6kZq0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKfge1dk3q83vQtChdi6dhTKmCVuES1_UdEayKA_ddrhA&oe=6A996D8F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ChatGPT Image 2026\u5e744\u670813\u65e5 02_52_07.png", "id": "959041316506141", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618064_959041319839474_5180109942903064021_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CtfHjtWPJs4Q7kNvwGkG2pg&_nc_oc=Adrx4PB_t6n-R4KPwMpwdyshwnzCZHnNlA2aWbCwdbHGLao3RbW3RhjO1HvL62yw8WM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKW2fZ2732jfoD06d-RlJYk6Ka5dz5VN-dYCt8YQIdpMQ&oe=6A999471"}, "display_name": "VoxelCross", "keywords": ["nonogram", "picross", "voxel", "puzzle", "voxelcross"], "long_description": "VoxelCross is a premium 3D nonogram (Picross-style) puzzle experience built for virtual reality.\n\nEnter a carefully crafted voxel world where logic and spatial reasoning come together. Guided by numerical clues, carve away blocks layer by layer to reveal hidden 3D structures.\n{813447825166772}\nDesigned specifically for VR, VoxelCross offers intuitive interaction, allowing players to inspect, rotate, and solve puzzles from any perspective.\nDesigned specifically for VR, VoxelCross offers intuitive interaction, allowing players to inspect, rotate, and solve puzzles from any perspective.\n\n\ud83e\udde9 Key Features\nFull 3D Nonogram Gameplay\nSolve puzzles in true three-dimensional space.\nPrecision VR Interaction\nComfortable and accurate controller-based input.\n80+ Curated Levels\nA smooth progression from beginner-friendly stages to more complex challenges.\nRewarding Visual Results\nEach puzzle reveals a unique voxel model.\nClean, Comfortable Visual Style\nDesigned for extended play in VR.\n\ud83c\udf31 Ongoing Development\n\nVoxelCross is an independently developed title with a focus on quality and long-term updates. More levels and features will continue to be added over time.\n\n\ud83d\udcac Feedback Welcome\n\nIf you encounter any issues or have suggestions, your feedback is always appreciated.\nIf you encounter any issues or have suggestions, your feedback is always appreciated.\n\nTake your time. Think in 3D. Solve in VR.", "short_description": "A relaxing yet challenging 3D nonogram (Picross-style) puzzle game designed for VR. Solve voxel-based puzzles using logic and spatial thinking, carve away blocks, and reveal hidden 3D models in an immersive and satisfying experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://my.feishu.cn/wiki/ZBbCwx9c2iVokYk9kqMcAL0Ynve", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "IndieGames Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://my.feishu.cn/wiki/DRUzwA9NRiWdLeklmSUcLe1jnwd", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26203007732734424"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "27825221777064343"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1798775038175573"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2560334024412623"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "27825221